      <h3 class="m3-pl-row__heading">FASARA™ — Frosted, etched, and branded glass aesthetics without the replacement cost</h3>
      <p class="m3-pl-row__body">Sandblasted or etched glass looks sharp - but it's permanent, expensive, and impossible to update when your branding changes. 3M FASARATM Glass Finishes are decorative window and glass films available in over 100 patterns: frosted, matte, geometric, translucent, and custom-printed. Applied to the interior glass surface, they deliver the same visual effect at a fraction of the cost and can be removed or updated at any time. Because FASARATM transmits diffused light rather than blocking it entirely, spaces stay bright while gaining full visual privacy.</p>
      <p class="m3-pl-row__body">In Philadelphia, FASARATM is most commonly used in conference rooms and office partitions (frosted privacy without total visual block), retail storefronts and lobbies (branded graphics and signage applied to glass), healthcare waiting areas (soothing translucent patterns that maintain natural light), and university and K-12 classroom partitions throughout University City and Center City. For full branding applications, FASARATM can be combined with 3M custom digital printing on a clear polyester base - creating fully bespoke glass graphics at commercial scale.</p>

