        <p class="m3-pl-row__warranty-note">Interior application. ~80% VLT. Best results on south- and east-facing clear or lightly tinted glazing. Qualifies for LEED EQ daylighting credits. 10-year commercial warranty. Film redirects - does not block - solar heat; combine with a solar control film on high-heat exposures for maximum benefit. Source: 3M.com</p>
