    <div class="m3-pl-row__content">
      <span class="m3-pl-row__num">06</span>
      <span class="m3-pl-row__eyebrow">3M Sun Control Window Film</span>
      <h3 class="m3-pl-row__heading">Night Vision Series — Daytime privacy, clear views after dark</h3>
      <p class="m3-pl-row__body">Most privacy films work against you at night - the same reflective coating that keeps people from seeing in during the day turns into a mirror from the inside once it gets dark. 3M Night Vision Series solves this with a metallized nano-coating engineered for asymmetric performance: high exterior reflectance during daylight hours creates a mirror effect that blocks inward views, while low interior reflectance preserves clear outward views after dark when interior lighting reverses the visual dynamic. Genuine daytime privacy, without the after-dark fishbowl effect.</p>
      <p class="m3-pl-row__body">The series spans three VLT levels - NV15 (15%), NV25 (24%), and NV35 (36%) - letting you dial in the privacy level and light transmission that matches your space. Philadelphia applications include restaurant dining rooms and bars on Passyunk and Rittenhouse Square, west-facing conference rooms in Center City towers, and retail storefronts on Walnut and Chestnut where display visibility from the street matters. One note: Night Vision uses a metallized coating, which can attenuate Wi-Fi and cellular signals on glass-heavy facades - worth factoring in on antenna-sensitive installations.</p>

